[I] Library for managing OS information for virtualization

[T] libosinfo is a GObject based library API for managing information about
[T] operating systems, hypervisors and the (virtual) hardware devices they
[T] support. It provides APIs to match and identify optimal devices for
[T] deploying an operating system on a hypervisor, and is available via
[T] GObject Introspection and Vala bindings.

[U] https://libosinfo.org/

[A] Libosinfo Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base
[F] CROSS

[E] opt vala
[E] opt gobject-introspection

[V] 1.12.0
[L] LGPL

[D] 325da0a042a201fd595eccfe7721360d69a7024cd6a26cadfa219fee libosinfo-v1.12.0.tar.gz https://gitlab.com/libosinfo/libosinfo/-/archive/v1.12.0/

var_append mesonopt ' ' -Denable-tests=false
pkginstalled gtk-doc docbook-xml docbook-xsl && ! atstage cross || var_append mesonopt ' ' -Denable-gtk-doc=false
